WEBVTT

00:00:30.735 --> 00:00:31.903
It didn't.

00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:32.945
(Laughter)

00:00:32.987 --> 00:00:36.574
Instead, I became fascinated by sex.

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:39.827
I wanted to hear
other people's stories about sex

00:00:39.869 --> 00:00:43.706
and watch all the movies
with all the sex scenes.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.212
Everything about this very taboo subject
was so intriguing to me.

00:00:49.629 --> 00:00:51.297
Well, now my mum's gone.

00:00:51.714 --> 00:00:53.591
Nine years this year.

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:55.885
And true to her word,

00:00:55.927 --> 00:00:58.846
the ugliest thing in the world
is a naked man with socks on.

00:00:58.888 --> 00:01:01.390
(Laughter)